  "question": {
    "text": "Six fair dice are rolled. The probability that the product of the numbers appearing on top faces is prime, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "This can be possible if five&nbsp;of the dice have <math><mn>1</mn></math> on top faces and one die has <math><mn>2,&#160;</mn><mn>3</mn></math> or <math><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence, required probability <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></math>"
  }
}